NOTE: solve term dominates on the diagonal (LA,relgen sub-rho per BIN-OBS-009).
Crossover n* is highly sensitive to c and to the omega*log2(C(N,D)) model constant;
this is the analytic shadow of PO-BIN-001(b) -- the genuinely open quantity.

RESULTS: measured fbexp confirms ~n^{2/3} scaling; crossover governed by solve constant.
